      "cooked": "<p>I just wanted to keep a record of these games, partly to see if any villains are over/under-represented (it might be worth picking games non-randomly in order to catch 'em all), and partly just because I can/want to/am bored. It's a sort of tiny statistics project in a bottle, and largely for my own amusement.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Vanilla Games</strong></p><p><a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/episode-1-advanced-baron-blade-victory-3363\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Episode 1:</a> Baron Blade (Pydro), vs Omnitron-X (MigrantP), Golem Unity (cmschex),&nbsp;<span>Haka (Mezike),&nbsp;</span><span>Tachyon (Ronway),&nbsp;</span><span>The Scholar (ketigid), in the Tomb of Anubis - VICTORY</span></p><p><a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/episode-2-advanced-kismet-victory-3484\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"><span>Episode 2:&nbsp;</span></a><span>Kismet (Pydro), vs&nbsp;</span><span>The Scholar (BlueHairedMeerkat),&nbsp;</span><span>Fanatic (cmschex),&nbsp;</span><span>Ra: Horus of Two Horizons (celette482), </span><span>Expatriette (ketigid),&nbsp;</span><span>Bunker: Engine of War (Zalrus9)</span><span>, in The FInal Wasteland - VICTORY</span></p><p><span><a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/episode-3-akashbhuta-victory-3493\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Episode 3:</a> Akash'Bhuta (Ronway), vs&nbsp;</span><span>Tempest (GreyWind), </span><span>Haka (Ronway),&nbsp;</span><span>Team Leader Tachyon (Zalrus9),&nbsp;</span><span>NightMist (Pydro), in the&nbsp;</span><span>Realm of Discord - VICTORY</span></p><p><a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/episode-4-the-ennead-advanced-3547\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"><span>Episode 4:&nbsp;</span></a><span>The Ennead (BlueHairedMeerkat), vs&nbsp;</span><span>Haka (cmschex),&nbsp;</span><span>Mr. Fixer (Kharnel),&nbsp;</span><span>The Visionary (Pydro), Freedom&nbsp;</span><span>Tempest (ketigid),&nbsp;</span><span>The Wraith: Price of Freedom (Mezike), in the&nbsp;</span><span>Time Cataclysm - DEFEAT</span></p><p><a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/episode-5-citizen-dawn-3921\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"><span>Episode 5:&nbsp;</span></a><span>Citizen Dawn (BlueHairedMeerkat), vs&nbsp;</span><span>Omnitron-X (Kharnel),&nbsp;</span><span>The Argent Adept (cmschex),&nbsp;</span><span>Bunker (PlatinumWarlock),&nbsp;</span><span>Expatriette (Greywind), in&nbsp;</span><span>The Tomb of Anubis - DEFEAT</span></p><p><a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/episode-6-grand-warlord-voss-3989\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"><span>Episode 6:&nbsp;</span></a><span>Grand Warlord Voss (BlueHairedMeerkat), vs&nbsp;</span><span>The Argent Adept (SmellyTie),&nbsp;</span><span>Chrono-Ranger (PlatinumWarlock),&nbsp;</span><span>Mr. Fixer (cmschex),&nbsp;</span><span>Expatriette (phantaskippy), in&nbsp;</span><span>Insula Primalis - VICTORY</span></p><p><a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/episode-7-cosmic-omnitron-4046\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"><span>Episode 7:&nbsp;</span></a><span>Cosmic Omnitron (BlueHairedMeerkat), vs&nbsp;</span><span>Chrono-Ranger (phantaskippy),&nbsp;</span><span>Wraith: Price of Freedom (Greywind),&nbsp;</span><span>Team Leader Tachyon (dpt),&nbsp;</span><span>G.I. Bunker (cmschex),&nbsp;</span><span>Fanatic (PlatinumWarlock), in&nbsp;</span><span>The Block - VICTORY</span></p><p><a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/episode-8-kismet-4069\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"><span>Episode 8:&nbsp;</span></a><span>Kismet (dpt), vs&nbsp;</span><span>Unity (BlueHairedMeerkat),&nbsp;</span><span>Tachyon (cmschex),&nbsp;</span><span>Ex-Patriette (phantaskippy),&nbsp;</span><span>The Argent Adept (PlatinumWarlock)&nbsp;</span><span>in&nbsp;</span><span>The Tomb of Anubis - VICTORY</span></p><p><a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/episode-9-plague-rat-4098\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Episode 9:&nbsp;</a><span>Plague Rat (cmschex), vs&nbsp;</span><span>Tempest (dpt),&nbsp;</span><span>Wraith (BlueHairedMeerkat),&nbsp;</span><span>Young Legacy (PlatinumWarlock),&nbsp;</span><span>Ra, Horus of Two Horizons (grim88),&nbsp;</span><span>Fanatic (phantomskippy),&nbsp;</span><span>in the&nbsp;</span><span>Ruins of Atlantis - VICTORY</span></p><p><a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/episode-10-la-capitan-advanced-4108\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"><span>Episode 10:&nbsp;</span></a><span>La Capitan (PlatinumWarlock), vs </span><span>Bunker (grim88),&nbsp;</span><span>The Eternal Haka (cmschex),&nbsp;</span><span>Mr. Fixer (dpt),&nbsp;</span><span>Omnitron-X (BlueHairedMeerkat),&nbsp;</span><span>Dark Visionary (phantaskippy),&nbsp;</span><span>in Wagner Mars Base - VICTORY</span></p><p><a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/episode-11-gloomweaver-re-visualized-4134\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Episode 11:</a> Gloomweaver [house-ruled] (phantaskippy), vs&nbsp;<span>Greatest Legacy (BlueHairedMeerkat),&nbsp;</span><span>Tachyon (grim88),&nbsp;</span><span>Omnitron-X (grysqrl),&nbsp;</span><span>Redeemer Fanatic (cmschex),&nbsp;</span><span>Argent Adept (dpt), in Insula Primalis - VICTORY</span></p><p><a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/episode-12-the-chairman-4171\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"><span>Episode 12:&nbsp;</span></a><span>The Chairman (BlueHairedMeerkat), vs&nbsp;</span><span>The Argent Adept (Matchstickman),&nbsp;</span><span>Nightmist (Ronway),&nbsp;</span><span>Bunker (grysgrl),&nbsp;</span><span>The Scholar (PlatinumWarlock),&nbsp;</span><span>Ra (phantaskippy), in&nbsp;</span><span>Wagner Mars Base - VICTORY</span></p><p><a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/episode-13-cosmic-omnitron-4195\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"><span>Episode 13:&nbsp;</span></a><span>Cosmic Omnitron (BlueHairedMeerkat), vs The Wraith:&nbsp;</span><span>Price of Freedom (PlatinumWarlock),&nbsp;</span><span>Expatriette (cmschex),&nbsp;</span><span>The Eternal Haka (grysgrl),&nbsp;</span><span>Bunker (phantaskippy/Envisioner),&nbsp;</span><span>Tachyon (Greywind), in&nbsp;</span><span>Silver Gulch, 1883 - VICTORY</span></p><p><a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/episode-14-bezaliel-the-apostate-4258\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"><span>Episode 14:&nbsp;</span></a><span>Apostate (BlueHairedMeerkat), vs Freedom&nbsp;</span><span>Tempest (dpt),&nbsp;</span><span>The Wraith: Price of Freedom (cmschex),&nbsp;</span><span>Mr Fixer (PlatinumWarlock),&nbsp;</span><span>The Scholar (grysqrl),&nbsp;</span><span>Fanatic the Redeemer (Silverleaf) in&nbsp;</span><span>The Realm of Discord - VICTORY</span></p><p><a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/episode-15-spite-4304\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"><span>Episode 15:&nbsp;</span></a><span>Spite (BlueHairedMeerkat), vs&nbsp;</span><span>Haka (dpt),&nbsp;</span><span>Dark Visionary (phantaskippy),&nbsp;</span><span>Golem Unity (grysqrl),&nbsp;</span><span>The Wraith (Envisioner),&nbsp;</span><span>Team Leader Tachyon (Matchstickman), in&nbsp;</span><span>Wagner Mars Base - VICTORY</span></p><p><a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/episode-16-kismet-4322\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"><span>Episode 16:&nbsp;</span></a><span>Kismet (BlueHairedMeerkat), vs&nbsp;</span><span>Bunker (Envisioner),&nbsp;</span><span>Tempest (cmschex),&nbsp;</span><span>Omnitron-X (Greywind),&nbsp;</span><span>Dark Visionary (dpt),&nbsp;</span><span>Chrono-Ranger (grysqrl), in&nbsp;</span><span>Insula Primalis - VICTORY</span></p><p><span><a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/episode-17-akashbhuta-4344\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Episode 17:</a> Akash'Bhuta (BlueHairedMeerkat), vs&nbsp;</span><span>Golem Unity (PlatinumWarlock), B</span><span>unker (dpt),&nbsp;</span><span>Dark Visionary (phantaskippy),&nbsp;</span><span>Legacy (cmschex),&nbsp;</span><span>Absolute Zero (Envisioner), in&nbsp;</span><span>The Final Wasteland - IN PROGRESS</span></p><