      "raw": "<p>I just wanted to keep a record of these games, partly to see if any villains are over/under-represented (it might be worth picking games non-randomly in order to catch &#39;em all), and partly just because I can/want to/am bored. It&#39;s a sort of tiny statistics project in a bottle, and largely for my own amusement.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Vanilla Games</strong></p><p><a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/episode-1-advanced-baron-blade-victory-3363\">Episode 1:</a> Baron Blade (Pydro), vs Omnitron-X (MigrantP), Golem Unity (cmschex),&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Haka (Mezike),&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Tachyon (Ronway),&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">The Scholar (ketigid), in the Tomb of Anubis - VICTORY</span></p><p><a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/episode-2-advanced-kismet-victory-3484\"><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Episode 2:&nbsp;</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Kismet (Pydro), vs&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">The Scholar (BlueHairedMeerkat),&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Fanatic (cmschex),&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Ra: Horus of Two Horizons (celette482), </span><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Expatriette (ketigid),&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Bunker: Engine of War (Zalrus9)</span><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">, in The FInal Wasteland - VICTORY</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\"><a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/episode-3-akashbhuta-victory-3493\">Episode 3:</a> Akash&#39;Bhuta (Ronway), vs&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Tempest (GreyWind), </span><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Haka (Ronway),&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Team Leader Tachyon (Zalrus9),&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">NightMist (Pydro), in the&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Realm of Discord - VICTORY</span></p><p><a href=\"https://grea